4580_1057862168476709_786709573957720739_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XFf9o4hNSk0Q7kNvwFjcnX0&_nc_oc=AdoAJGCdRiQk9A3zIcreL4mnERLXZAohcAG8h1EPC2jf4BS9x0idWqS5JST30uFh2Nc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxJX_7DvbPt2fAZnqImv1vA3XjbVlsk7eD8rB6H8vqGDg&oe=69C9102B"}, "display_name": "Reaction of Zinc with Hydrochloric Acid", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab delivers an exceptional and immersive educational experience for exploring the reaction of zinc with hydrochloric acid. Within this virtual laboratory, users are empowered to actively participate in experiments, investigate the substances' unique properties, and witness the captivating reactions that unfold in a secure and interactive environment.\n\nAn expert virtual lab assistant can readily guide you through the experiment process, offering outstanding support and expertise. Furthermore, users can conduct independent experiments, reinforcing their understanding without external assistance.\n\nThis exceptional platform transforms the learning process by simulating these experiments in an immersive and interactive manner, ensuring a profound understanding of the zinc and hydrochloric acid reaction while enhancing knowledge retention.", "short_description": "XR Guru's VR Chemistry Lab delivers an exceptional and immersive educational experience for exploring the reaction of zinc with hydrochloric acid. Within this virtual laboratory, users are empowered to actively participate in experiments, investigate the substances' unique properties, and witness the captivating reactions that unfold in a secure and interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "c